# Safety boundary for `wt step copy-ignored --require-include` (ADR-0024 §3).
#
# A file copies only when it is BOTH gitignored AND matched here. Review rule:
# only non-secret / cacheable / lifecycle-safe paths. Never `.env`, credentials,
# tokens, sockets, DB data, or other mutable runtime state.
#
# `target/` seeds ONLY on verified-reflink hosts (APFS/btrfs/XFS/ReFS); on this
# ext4 host it is currently excluded by `.config/wt.toml`
# ([step.copy-ignored] exclude = ["target/"]) because a full copy would worsen
# capacity. Copied artifacts are still fingerprinted by Cargo and are not
# validation evidence for current source.
target/

